  {
   "name": "Standard Bearer",
   "needs": [
    "static:must-target-flagbearer"
   ],
   "size": "small",
   "why": "Small, not reached (B343, combat-targeting lane): the engine check fits in whyTargetsInvalid (rule 601.2c), but a legal action offers targets slot by slot (targetOptions), which cannot say \"at least one target must be a Flagbearer\" across several slots, up-to slots, any-number groups or modes; it needs an offer field (mustTargetOneOf) obeyed by the client target picker and both bots (pickTargets, aimedTargets)."
  },
